From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ManuelArto <manuelartociao@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:34:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] test(daisugi): pin Nethermind's ComputeDepsHash vectors

The same dependency lists and expected digests as Nethermind's FrameDependencyTests
(NethermindEth/nethermind#15829): empty, leanSPHINCS-only, duplicates, leanSTARK-only, mixed, the same data and
key under both schemes, and a scheme below 0x10 that must join the second list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
